vl9pPr></a:lstStyle><a:p><a:pPr marL="190500" indent="-256032"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"/><a:t>“We are able to show what we’ve delivered. It’s a testament to the way that we’ve been working with IBM. </a:t></a:r><a:br><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"/></a:br><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"/><a:t>We are not just talking agile; we are proving </a:t></a:r><a:br><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"/></a:br><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"/><a:t>it through delivery.”</a:t></a:r><a:br><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2800" dirty="0"/></a:br><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="2800" dirty="0"/></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="190500" indent="-256032"/><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="2800" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="IBM Plex Sans Medm" panose="020B0503050203000203" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="190500" indent="-256032"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2800" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="IBM Plex Sans Medm" panose="020B0503050203000203" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>	Jay Sadier</a:t></a:r><a:br><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2800" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="IBM Plex Sans Medm" panose="020B0503050203000203" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr></a:br><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2800" dirty="0"/><a:t>Head of Digital Product &amp; Transformation, Audi UK</a:t></a:r></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="10" name="Text Placeholder 11"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{9555EB2B-28C9-883F-74ED-AA964AA20440}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr><a:spLocks noGrp="1"/></p:cNvSpPr><p:nvPr><p:ph type="body" sz="quarter" idx="11"/></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="576000" y="4575600"/><a:ext cx="9773690" cy="7643432"/></a:xfrm></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2800" dirty="0"/><a:t>With 90% of car purchases now starting online, Audi UK is reimagining its digital experiences to complement the entire customer journey. To improve digital front-end development and analytics, the team tapped into the IBM and Adobe partnership. Audi UK moved to the latest version of Adobe Experience Manager and worked with the IBM team to build the custom website’s analytics platform from scratch on Adobe Analytics. </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="2800" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="accent1"/></a:solidFill></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="2800" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="accent1"/></a:solidFill></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="2800" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="accent1"/></a:solidFill></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="2800" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="accent1"/></a:solidFill></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2800" dirty="0"/><a:t>More information:</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="2800" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="accent1"/></a:solidFill></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2800" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="accent1"/></a:solidFill></a:rPr><a:t>Audi UK →</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2800" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="accent1"/></a:solidFill></a:rPr><a:t>IBM and Adobe partnership →</a:t></a:r></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp></p:spTree><p:extLst><p:ext uri="{BB962C8B-B14F-4D97-AF65-F5344CB8AC3E}"><p14:creationId xmlns:p14="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/powerpoint/2010/main" val="793712305"/></p:ext></p:extLst></p:cSld><p:clrMapOvr><a:masterClrMapping/></p:clrMapOvr><p:transition spd="med"/></p:sld>